-model\\naaa authentication login default group radius\\naaa authentication login radius-access group radius\\n##\\n\\nExplanation:\\n1. `aaa new-model` enables AAA services in Cisco (required for RADIUS authentication)\\n2. The first command translates to setting RADIUS as the default authentication method\\n3. The second command creates a specific authentication method named \"radius-access\" using RADIUS\\n\\nThe Cisco commands combine both Juniper statements into a more Cisco-typical AAA configuration structure.', 'trans_template': 'aaa authentication login radius-access group radius'}]]": 1,
